# Printable parts to render and gate in CI. The default render is the
# assembled preview, never a deliverable. Every part is exported in its print
# orientation: cradle, rack and end-cap as they stand in use, the spindle on
# end. The joint coupon is auto-discovered by filename
# (tape-strip-rack-coupon.scad) and needs no line here.
cradle
spindle
rack
end-cap
